  abstract = {The multi-step matrix splitting iteration (MPIO) for computing PageRank is an efficient iterative method by  combining the multi-step power method with the inner-outer iterative method. In this paper, with the aim of accelerating the computation of PageRank problems, a new method is proposed by preconditioning the MPIO method with an adaptive generalized Arnoldi (GArnoldi) method. The new method is called as an adaptive GArnoldi-MPIO method, whose construction and convergence analysis are discussed in detail. Numerical experiments on several PageRank problems are reported to illustrate the effectiveness of our proposed method.},
